OL,3,GNEWSAOvernight road closures for
OL,4,Afurther wildfire repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dual carriageway that was closed for
OL,7,Fnearly two weeks due to a wildfire is
OL,8,Fto shut overnight for further repair
OL,9,Fwork over two weeks.
OL,11,FA major incident was declared after a
OL,12,Fvan fire on the A31 in the New Forest
OL,13,Fnear Ringwood, Hampshire, on 9 August
OL,14,Fwent on to destroy about 0.6 sq miles
OL,15,F(1.6 sq km) of heathland.
OL,17,FThe road reopened on 22 August but
OL,18,Fovernight closures will be put in place
OL,19,Funtil 11 September for work to replace
OL,20,Fthe safety barrier along both
OL,21,Fcarriageways and remove any further
OL,22,Ftrees damaged by the fire.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
